[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2684912371","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103308#issuecomment-2684912371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103308","id":2684912371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gCILz","user":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-26T13:08:35Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T13:08:35Z","body":"Have you tried pipeline precompilication instancing? https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/performance/pipeline_compilations.html#pipeline-precompilation-instancing\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2684912371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2685549374","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103308#issuecomment-2685549374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103308","id":2685549374,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gEjs-","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-26T16:19:04Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T16:19:04Z","body":"> Have you tried pipeline precompilication instancing?\n\nI gave it a go:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53becb6c-c7b0-4c43-98b1-888665ed5294\n\nThe extra copy of the GPUParticles2D, named GPUParticles2D2, has an AnimationPlayer attached that simply sets `emitting` to `true` on scene load. \n\nWhat doesn't appear to work:\n - When GPUParticles2D2 is invisible, then even though it presumably emits on scene startup, the stutter still happens when the user-controlled emission happens for the first time (about 0:29 in the video). \n\nWhat does appear to work:\n- When GPUParticles2D2 is visible, then the stutter from the user-controlled emission doesn't happen. \n- Positioning GPUParticles2D2 outside of the camera's view, but keeping it visible, does prevent the stutter when the user activates the emission (not shown in the video).\n- (Not mentioned in the article and not recorded in the video) If GPUParticles2D2 is placed within a SubViewport so that it is never drawn to the screen regardless of where the camera goes, the stutter doesn't happen.\n\nThe last approach here - using a SubViewport as sort of a \"pocket dimension\" to get the particle systems precompiled - is probably what I'll use for now. \n\nThat being said, this all seems to me a strange and unintuitive set of hoops for someone to need to jump through. Having a particle system activate when some criteria are met is an extremely common use case, so the stutter problem will be extremely common. The official solution provided in the docs is really just a workaround (they even refer to it as such themselves), so there should be a more \"proper\" and intuitive way to precompile shaders.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2685549374/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2686490704","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103308#issuecomment-2686490704","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103308","id":2686490704,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gIJhQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repo