ue is \"closed\" only insomuch as the Godot maintainers wish to keep its discussion contained to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10956, so that all information about it (potential workarounds, solutions, etc) can be easily found in a centralized place.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751597187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]